  "body": "The simplest thing we could do for a v2 as @lukewagner suggested is introduce the ability for sites to mint new boxes that are either \"atomic\" or \"persistent\" (if they have permission).\n\nThere's two ways I see we could integrate with IDB and the Cache API. Either they have accessors on boxes or you pass a box when you create new instances of either IDB or Cache.\n",
